  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting cleantech innovation and entrepreneurship for climate action, biodiversity and green jobs in Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to support Algeria#s efforts to mitigate GHG emissions, enable a just energy transition, and conserve biodiversity by promoting innovative clean technology (cleantech) solutions with high-impact potential.##The project#s key approach in achieving this aim is through enhancing the capacity and competitiveness of Algeria#s private sector, with focus on micro, small and medium sized enterprises (MSMEs) and startups, and the surrounding cleantech innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystem (CIEE), to accelerate the development, deployment, and scale-up of cleantech solutions. The project will prioritize and promote cleantech innovations that contribute to biodiversity conservation and the sustainable use of natural resources, such as nature-based solutions, ecosystem-friendly technologies, and sustainable land and water management practices.</narrative>
  </description>
